# Optional sketch: AWS ECS Fargate + ALB (not wired into main.tf).
# Use as a reading map — fill account IDs, subnets and ECR before apply.
#
# High-level resources:
#   1. ECR repository + docker push of Clase 6_parte_2 image
#   2. ECS cluster + Fargate task definition (env: LLM_*)
#   3. Service + Application Load Balancer
#   4. Secrets Manager for LLM_API_KEY
#
# CLI alternative (zero Terraform):
#   aws ecr create-repository --repository-name sql-agent-toy
#   docker build -t sql-agent-toy .
#   docker tag sql-agent-toy:latest $ACCOUNT.dkr.ecr.$REGION.amazonaws.com/sql-agent-toy:latest
#   docker push ...
#   aws ecs create-cluster --cluster-name sql-agent-toy
#   # then register task + service with awsvpc, public subnet, security group :8000
